Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

vendor/ holds four crates of arti 0.46.0 (arti-client, tor-dirmgr, tor-hsservice,
tor-persist), Copyright The Tor Project, Inc., licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0, with small
wasm-only patches marked "Ephem patch" (vendor/README.md). They keep their own
licenses; the PolyForm license and the SPDX headers of this project do not apply to
them.

Every other dependency is an unmodified crates.io or npm package resolved at build
time (Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, checks/package.json) under its own license. The built
WebAssembly in app/pkg/ links such crates (among them arti, rustls, ring, snow,
curve25519-dalek, qrcode, rqrr); their licenses are MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-style, ISC
or the ring license, all permissive.
